{"problem":"How many subsets of {1, 2,..., 10} have no two successive numbers?","reference_answer":"144","reference_solution":"For each subset of the set {1, ..., n}, we map it to a length-n string of 0s and 1s, where a digit 1 at i-th place means that i is in the subset.
